ematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2502.19542:I003","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-003","focus_relation":"different_operation_step_or_formula","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2502.19542:I003:U001","2502.19542:I003:U002"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-003:U001","ISSUE-003:U003"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"ISSUE-003 addresses a backwards support-containment inference in the admissibility proof. It does not identify the omitted loop iteration at the current finest level or the missing creation of level L+1 data for marks in marked_els[L].","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2502.19542:I004","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-006","focus_relation":"different_operation_step_or_formula","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2502.19542:I004:U001","2502.19542:I004:U002","2502.19542:I004:U003"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-006:U001","ISSUE-006:U002"],"same_causal_subject":true,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"ISSUE-006 concerns shortest-chain classification returning true without checking intermediate basis functions. It does not diagnose the initializer's deletion of pre-existing unresolved pairs whose supports miss the current marks, or the resulting failure to repair those pairs.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2502.19542:I005","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-003","focus_relation":"different_obligation_or_hypothesis","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2502.19